WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:05.610
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:05.611 --> 00:00:07.927
What do they see?

3
00:00:07.928 --> 00:00:14.581
They see a movie theater.

4
00:00:14.582 --> 00:00:21.307
The blobs go inside.

5
00:00:21.308 --> 00:00:39.780
They watch tickets come out.

6
00:00:39.781 --> 00:01:06.206
They watch popcorn pop.

7
00:01:06.207 --> 00:01:33.026
They watch hot dogs turn.

8
00:01:33.027 --> 00:01:57.093
They watch soda come out.

9
00:01:57.094 --> 00:02:10.097
They watch escalators move.

10
00:02:10.098 --> 00:02:23.106
They watch a movie.

11
00:02:23.107 --> 00:02:27.765
Blobs, are you sleepy?

12
00:02:27.766 --> 00:02:30.859
Yes, they are!

13
00:02:30.860 --> 00:02:33.672
Silly blobs.

14
00:02:33.673 --> 00:02:35.907
Good-bye.

